---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Tasarım sistemi"
  description="Fernas statik site tasarım sistemi: renk, tipografi, bileşenler ve ölçüler."
  noindex
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="shell">
      <p class="eyebrow">Tasarım sistemi</p>
      <h1 class="mt-5 max-w-[14ch] font-display text-[clamp(3rem,7vw,7rem)] font-semibold leading-[0.86] tracking-[-0.06em]">
        Saha İndeksi.
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-[1.05rem] leading-relaxed text-ink/70">
        Renk, tipografi, ölçü ve bileşenler. Bu sayfa yayına dahil edilmez;
        tasarım kararlarının referansıdır.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section rule">
    <div class="shell">
      <h2 class="font-display text-[2rem] font-semibold tracking-[-0.04em]">Renk</h2>
      <div class="mt-8 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-6">
        {[
          ["Ink", "#061522", "bg-ink", "text-white"],
          ["Blue", "#045091", "bg-blue", "text-white"],
          ["Chalk", "#EEF2F1", "bg-chalk", "text-ink"],
          ["Steel", "#7A8C97", "bg-steel", "text-white"],
          ["Amber", "#E08A2B", "bg-amber", "text-ink"],
          ["White", "#FFFFFF", "bg-white", "text-ink"],
        ].map(([name, hex, bg, fg]) => (
          <div class={`${bg} ${fg} border border-steel/20 p-4`}>
            <p class="mono text-[0.62rem] opacity-70">{hex}</p>
            <p class="mt-10 font-display text-[1.2rem] font-semibold">{name}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section rule">
    <div class="shell grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-12">
      <div class="lg:col-span-5">
        <h2 class="font-display text-[2rem] font-semibold tracking-[-0.04em]">Tipografi</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 max-w-md text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-ink/65">
          Archivo başlıklarda, IBM Plex Sans gövdede, IBM Plex Mono yalnızca
          ölçülen verilerde kullanılır.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <p class="mono text-[0.62rem] text-steel">ARCHIVO / DISPLAY</p>
        <p class="mt-3 font-display text-[clamp(2.5rem,6vw,5.5rem)] font-semibold leading-[0.9] tracking-[-0.055em]">
          Ölçülebilir iş.
        </p>
        <p class="mono mt-8 text-[0.62rem] text-steel">IBM PLEX SANS / GÖVDE</p>
        <p class="mt-3 max-w-xl text-[1rem] leading-relaxed text-ink/75">
          İnşaattan enerjiye, doğalgaz dağıtımından gıdaya; Fernas, ölçülebilir
          işler ve uzun vadeli işletme disiplini üzerine kurulu bir şirketler grubu.
        </p>
        <p class="mono mt-8 text-[0.62rem] text-steel">IBM PLEX MONO / VERİ</p>
        <p class="mono mt-3 text-[0.9rem]">570 MW · 485 MW · 14 TESİS · 1,5M NÜFUS</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section rule">
    <div class="shell">
      <h2 class="font-display text-[2rem] font-semibold tracking-[-0.04em]">Bileşenler</h2>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#">Birincil</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#">İkincil</a>
        <a class="link-underline" href="#">Bağlantı</a>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="blueprint-grid border border-steel/30 p-6">
          <p class="mono text-[0.62rem] text-steel">ÖLÇÜM</p>
          <p class="mt-4 font-display text-[4rem] font-semibold leading-none tracking-[-0.06em]">
            570<span class="ml-2 align-top text-[0.24em] text-amber">MW</span>
          </p>
          <p class="mt-4 text-[0.85rem] text-ink/60">Kurulu güç / yenilenebilir</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-steel/30">
          <div class="project-row">
            <span class="project-row__num">01</span>
            <span class="project-row__title">Örnek proje satırı</span>
            <span class="project-row__meta">Enerji</span>
            <span class="project-row__meta">Ankara · 2026</span>
            <span class="project-row__arrow">↗</span>
          </div>
          <div class="project-row">
            <span class="project-row__num">02</span>
            <span class="project-row__title">İkinci proje satırı</span>
            <span class="project-row__meta">İnşaat</span>
            <span class="project-row__meta">Sinop · 2018</span>
            <span class="project-row__arrow">↗</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section rule">
    <div class="shell grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-12">
      <div class="lg:col-span-5">
        <h2 class="font-display text-[2rem] font-semibold tracking-[-0.04em]">Form</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-ink/65">
          Alanlar 1px çizgi, 2.8rem yükseklik ve görünür odak halkası kullanır.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <form class="grid gap-4">
          <label class="grid gap-2 text-[0.78rem] font-medium">
            Ad ve soyad
            <input class="min-h-11 border border-steel/40 bg-white px-3 text-[0.95rem]" type="text" placeholder="Adınız" />
          </label>
          <label class="grid gap-2 text-[0.78rem] font-medium">
            E-posta
            <input class="min-h-11 border border-steel/40 bg-white px-3 text-[0.95rem]" type="email" placeholder="ornek@firma.com" />
          </label>
          <label class="grid gap-2 text-[0.78rem] font-medium">
            Mesaj
            <textarea class="min-h-28 border border-steel/40 bg-white px-3 py-2 text-[0.95rem]" placeholder="Kısa bir not"></textarea>
          </label>
          <button class="btn btn-primary justify-self-start" type="button">Gönder</button>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
